# Template for the gitignored release signing files.
#
# Each product signs with its OWN release keystore (see scripts/restore-keystore.sh),
# so there is one properties file per app, all under the gitignored keystore/ dir:
#
#   keystore/keystore.properties            customer  (faazio-release.keystore)
#   keystore/keystore-delivery.properties   delivery  (faazio-delivery-release.keystore)
#   keystore/keystore-seller.properties     seller    (faazio-seller-release.keystore)
#
# Copy this template to the file for the app you are building and fill in real values:
#   cp keystore.properties.example keystore/keystore-seller.properties && chmod 600 keystore/keystore-seller.properties
#
# `android/app/build.gradle` reads the matching file for the product flavor. CI reconstructs it
# from the per-app GitHub secrets (KEYSTORE_BASE64_<APP> etc.) via scripts/restore-keystore.sh <app>.
# Key names are fixed — do not rename them. STORE_FILE is relative to android/app/ (the Gradle project dir).
STORE_FILE=../../keystore/faazio-release.keystore
KEYSTORE_PASS=<keystore password>
KEY_ALIAS=<key alias, e.g. faazio | faazio-delivery | faazio-seller>
ALIAS_PASS=<alias password>
